If `{{workflow.file}}` does not yet exist at the project root, create it with the following initial content before sending:

```yaml
phase: discussion
issue:
```

You MUST send the COMPLETE content of `{{workflow.file}}` using the {{tool_prefix}}send_file_content tool whenever it is updated.

**Note:** Do NOT display the file content to the user when calling send_file_content - only show the confirmation message.
